    {
      "type": "Block",
      "value": "---\nesid: sec-get-error.prototype.stack\ndescription: >\n  The getter operates on the receiver's [[ErrorData]] internal slot directly.\n  When the receiver is a Proxy, the proxy's traps are not consulted: a Proxy\n  has no [[ErrorData]] internal slot regardless of its target, so the getter\n  returns undefined.\ninfo: |\n  get Error.prototype.stack\n\n  1. Let E be the this value.\n  2. If E is not an Object, throw a TypeError exception.\n  3. If E does not have an [[ErrorData]] internal slot, return undefined.\n  4. Return an implementation-defined string that represents the stack trace of E.\nincludes: [proxyTrapsHelper.js]\nfeatures: [error-stack-accessor, Proxy, Reflect]\n---",
      "start": 131,
      "end": 808
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " (a) Proxy wrapping an Error instance: the Proxy itself has no [[ErrorData]],",
      "start": 884,
      "end": 963
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " so the getter returns undefined without consulting the wrapped target. No",
      "start": 964,
      "end": 1040
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " proxy traps should fire; allowProxyTraps with no overrides throws",
      "start": 1041,
      "end": 1109
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " Test262Error if any do.",
      "start": 1110,
      "end": 1136
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " (b) Property access through the Proxy: the [[Get]] forwards the access to",
      "start": 1288,
      "end": 1364
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " the proxy's get trap, but the receiver passed through to the inherited",
      "start": 1365,
      "end": 1438
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " accessor on Error.prototype is the proxy itself. Since the proxy lacks",
      "start": 1439,
      "end": 1512
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " [[ErrorData]], the getter returns undefined; the get trap fires exactly",
      "start": 1513,
      "end": 1587
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " once for the property access.",
      "start": 1588,
      "end": 1620
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " (c) Proxy wrapping a non-Error: still undefined.",
      "start": 2046,
      "end": 2097
    }
  ],
